# DMW3 PC Edition stage data v1 (edit in-game with F2 + --dev, or by hand)
# exit  x y w h TARGET [arriveX arriveY]
# npc   talk  SPRITE x y dir "Name" "Line one|Line two"
# walls original = walls from the game's own walk map (DAT/FIELD/STAGE/S###TMPK.BIN)
#
# ASUKA CITY MAIN LOBBY (S210) - where a new PC Edition game starts (reference shot 38: the player arrives on the
# right platform from the Login Room door, decoded trigger zone 0xA2 at 720,359).
# spawn: in front of that door (the decoded WSTAG spawn 284,308 is the centre emblem used by the opening).
# exits: decoded trigger zones 0x20 (west corridor) and 0xE1 (south-east corridor). Their targets are hand-picked:
#   both lead out to Asuka City S200, arriving below the lobby door (S200 trigger 0xA5 at 976,200).
#   Doors 0xA2/0xA3/0xA4/0x65 (Login Room, side rooms) are not linked yet: their interiors are unknown.
# npcs: on the decoded event actor spots, so talking shows the ORIGINAL lines from your disc
#   (WSTAG210 talk table: Tamer Service "hints" counter + Guide "Digimon Online Help Counter").
spawn 735 398
exit 56 392 57 33 S200 1010 262
exit 704 584 40 25 S200 1010 262
npc talk P044OPFS 384 255 1 "Tamer Service" "Welcome."
npc talk P043OPMA 434 247 7 "Guide" "This is the Help Counter."
